{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1000_p", "source_sha256": "87086b40e1bf8972c97aa07a48b0cb25298a677690f5c00a4bb199331b968491", "ja": "（百合子がプロデュースした服が発売された。\n感想を上げてくれる人もいて、売れ行きも好調だ……）", "zh": "（百合子制作的服装发售了。也有人发来感想，销量也很不错……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "c66b220ce3009f51ab8803a7d9a8afe5697500dfadfd03b04b573ecc7fb21524", "ja": "{$P$}さん、聞いてください！\nた、大変な……！　い、一大事が……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请听我说！\n不、不好了……！出、出大事了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1002_p", "source_sha256": "09c94be3a6fb2770390ddc3be1276c412ab5bbdda6de84f36e1537070d5628f7", "ja": "百合子、なんか混乱してないか？\nまあ、ちょっと落ち着いて……。", "zh": "百合子，你是不是有点乱了？\n好了，先稍微冷静一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "7191ddcb6acb9b179cff47b880d3f6c0c35422466861cb47b821d16fc3f3a1a3", "ja": "はあ……はあ……すみません。\nでも私、どうしても話がしたいんです……！", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……对不起。\n但是，我无论如何都想和您谈谈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "50b7f62dbe02d0ce7f46cc830b7d0fa7c5e51603a4fc12ef214711e74f5d2ae4", "ja": "その……今、受け取ったファンレターを読んでいたん\nです！　そしたら告白に成功したって……きゃ～！！", "zh": "那个……我刚才在读收到的粉丝来信！然后发现有人告白成功了……呀～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1005_p", "source_sha256": "65fe5f657826821955a7996f5c87e3ac84d4e863f7c92cb685bff0337a58b879", "ja": "そ、そうか……。喜んでるとこ悪いけど、\n順を追って説明してくれないか？", "zh": "这、这样啊……。虽然不想打扰你高兴，但能不能按顺序解释一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "3aff1b96c06c2bf621ed952dccc22910be4f65f330db2324d71001d4ff995c79", "ja": "ハッ！　そうですよね！　えーっと……手紙で\n「私の服が楽しみ」って書いてくれた子がいるんです。", "zh": "哈！确实是这样！呃……有个孩子在信里写道：\n“很期待我的服装。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "15a1f5f5274f8c88d7a2707dbad4044232848804d38aff6a5a394b5096b19616", "ja": "その子も読書が好きで、好きな作品の傾向も近くて……\n私が勝手に、身近に感じてたんです。", "zh": "那孩子也喜欢读书，喜欢的作品类型也和我很接近……是我自作主张地觉得她很亲近。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "dad5d1f2f64407c183a7fd41296dca2963a6a8a2efc6a9f34bc2e3cd23e44bee", "ja": "それで「服を買ったら、してみたいことがある」って\n書いてあって……少し気になってたんですけど。", "zh": "然后，她写着“买了衣服之后，有件想做的事”……\n所以我有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8d4fed9f2cc11d83cd70bf8829b4e3a424594ec82c0990d2272d63b3b03badfd", "ja": "あっ。まさか……告白？", "zh": "啊。难道是……告白？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "d278436c94e07c30450bb938d0f86dbcb7cbd4b2efd655702aaa6ef535f38768", "ja": "そうなんです！　この服で自信がついたって……。\nデートに誘って、告白したそうなんですっ！", "zh": "没错！听说穿上这件衣服后有了自信……还邀请对方约会，然后告白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "0fe29e641018dfb87adc29850614e6ad3b80515e1f2db028c847f500868082f6", "ja": "なんだか、恋愛小説みたいじゃありませんか？\nはぁ～……まさか私が、恋の後押しをできるなんて！", "zh": "总觉得，这不就像恋爱小说一样吗？\n唉～……没想到我居然也能为爱情推一把！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ff1617388867e3bbeece644a5e16abe3e85f02b555d0f325b4c35562d0179159", "ja": "そういうことが……。服のテーマにした\n『理想の文学少女』が見事に刺さったみたいだな。", "zh": "原来是这么回事……看来以服装为主题的『理想的文学少女』，正好打动她了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "e5ca963d45982c7fdaa81e9e0af79a40dbabd0a5581e7b96e03b2682cafce928", "ja": "はい！　「こういう服が欲しかったんです！」って、\nお礼まで言われちゃって……私、もう嬉しくて♪", "zh": "是的！对方还说“我一直想要这样的衣服！”甚至向我道谢了……我真的好开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "58f9993ab91227d47586f42a84f933b774f4f0dd70a79576ae812c2a0a10c595", "ja": "やっぱり、お気に入りの服を着ると\n自分に自信がつきますよね。私も、よくわかります。", "zh": "果然，只要穿上喜欢的衣服，\n就会对自己更有自信呢。我也很懂这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "e6fbfd3e1819e15680f8ddaa0e4089428c4f93cb1b66bc2b4e32a54780404e97", "ja": "ステージを向いて、怖気づきそうになる時、\nいつも衣装が、勇気をくれますから……。", "zh": "每当面对舞台，快要感到害怕退缩时，衣装总会给予我勇气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5b40da5455a22f2a0e207524450c889985cf7e8c2bfff3fecf8994567616a3fc", "ja": "勇気か……。手紙の子も、\n百合子と同じように立ち向かったのかもな。", "zh": "勇气啊……信里的那个孩子，说不定也和百合子一样勇敢面对了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0694_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0694_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "ddf2cf2af840aa5f9c97e797c677e48a8f4d6355083ab6c100e5bc2a75bf63b2", "ja": "そうですね。ふふ、本当によかったです。\n……それで、あの！　実は私も……。", "zh": "是啊。呵呵，真是太好了。\n……那个，其实我也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
